# Publish only Openflow-owned project files. Upstream checkouts stay independent.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/REQUIREMENTS.md
!/CONTRIBUTING.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/docs/
!/docs/**
!/.github/
!/.github/**
!/openflow.code-workspace

# Local configuration, secrets, generated files and tooling state.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/__pycache__/
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules/
